gSb(){return'"It\'s okay, I don\'t blame you. At least... I always believed you\'d come."\n"Were you... delayed by something?"\n"Y... yes."\n\n*...Yeah.*\n*What exactly delayed I?*'},
gSa(){return'"Just a little more, just a little more..."\nThe bartender slides a hot soup to you. The rain outside hides your frustration.'},
gSf(){return'"Heavy breathing in the dark. It\'s there, watching you."\n"You have no way back, draw your sword."'},
gS9(){return"Bells ring in the square, the crowd cheers. Today is a day to celebrate."},
gS5(){return'"The fire crackles, warmth wraps your tired body."\n"Good job today, get some rest."'},
gSe(){return'"The starlight is quiet."\n"I wonder if you, far away, are looking at the same sky?"'},
gSc(){return'"The mist dampens your cloak, the path ahead is unclear."\n"But the footsteps must not stop."'},
gSd(){return'"Raindrops tap on the window, the tavern is warm."\n"But your mind is still far away."'},
gSg(){return'"The hawkers cry out, the worldly smoke always soothes the heart."'},
gS6(){return'"Ripples on the water, the float bobs gently."\n"A rare moment to daze."'},
gSh(){return'"Sunlight filters through the canopy in dappled shadows."\n"Take a nap under the ancient tree."'},
gS7(){return'"Dawn breaks through the sea of clouds, the wind is cold."\n"But a new day has begun."'},
gS8(){return"The journey continues, the scenery ahead is waiting for you."},
ga8I(){return"Every journey has its own story"},
ga8H(){return"Your adventure scene changes with time and your actions. Success, setbacks, challenges, and rest can all bring different moments."},
